  "recognized_text": "Good morning. Customer service. How can I help you? Hi. I'm calling about my internet again. It keeps stopping every evening. I'm sorry to hear that. When did it start? About a week ago. It stops at around 8:00 and comes back at about 10:00. A technician came last Tuesday and reset the router, but it's happened every night since then. I see. Is it causing you a lot of problems? Yes, it's a real problem because I have online classes in the evening. I've missed two classes this week. I understand. I can send a technician on Thursday between 9:00 and 12:00. Or because you need it for your classes, we can send you a new router tomorrow. Is the new router easy to set up? I'd like to fix this as soon as possible. Yes, it takes about 10 minutes. You just follow the card in the box. Then please send the new router tomorrow. And if it still doesn't work, can the technician come on Thursday? Of course. I'll book Thursday too, and you can cancel it if everything's fine. Great. So a new router tomorrow and a technician on Thursday between 9:00 and 12:00, just in case. Thanks. Bye.",
  "source_text": "Good morning, customer service. How can I help you? Hi. I'm calling about my internet again. It keeps stopping every evening. I'm sorry to hear that. When did it start? About a week ago. It stops at around eight and comes back at about ten. A technician came last Tuesday and reset the router, but it's happened every night since then. I see. Is it causing you a lot of problems? Yes, it's a real problem, because I have online classes in the evening. I've missed two classes this week. I understand. I can send a technician on Thursday between nine and twelve. Or, because you need it for your classes, we can send you a new router tomorrow. Is the new router easy to set up? I'd like to fix this as soon as possible. Yes, it takes about ten minutes. You just follow the card in the box. Then please send the new router tomorrow. And if it still doesn't work, can the technician come on Thursday? Of course. I'll book Thursday too, and you can cancel it if everything's fine. Great. So a new router tomorrow, and a technician on Thursday between nine and twelve, just in case. Thanks, bye.",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good morning, customer service. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi. I'm calling about my internet again. It keeps stopping every evening."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. When did it start?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "About a week ago. It stops at around eight and comes back at about ten. A technician came last Tuesday and reset the router, but it's happened every night since then."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I see. Is it causing you a lot of problems?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Yes, it's a real problem, because I have online classes in the evening. I've missed two classes this week."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I understand. I can send a technician on Thursday between nine and twelve. Or, because you need it for your classes, we can send you a new router tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Is the new router easy to set up? I'd like to fix this as soon as possible."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes, it takes about ten minutes. You just follow the card in the box."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Then please send the new router tomorrow. And if it still doesn't work, can the technician come on Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Of course. I'll book Thursday too, and you can cancel it if everything's fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great. So a new router tomorrow, and a technician on Thursday between nine and twelve, just in case. Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
